## 4. Lifecycle state machine

### 4.1 States

| Status | Meaning | Detail block required | Terminal |
|---|---|---|---|
| `PROPOSED` | Asserted; no evidence yet. The only state where `evidence_refs` may be empty. | — | no |
| `CANDIDATE` | Evidence attached; awaiting ratification. | — | no |
| `ACTIVE` | Promoted. Canonical knowledge; safe to read. | — | no |
| `DEPRECATED` | Still true, discouraged. | `deprecation` | no |
| `SUPERSEDED` | Replaced by a named node. | `superseded_by` | near — only → `RETRACTED` |
| `QUARANTINED` | Integrity suspect; frozen pending Adversary review. Truth undetermined. | `quarantine` | no |
| `RETRACTED` | Falsified. **Tombstone.** | `retraction` | **absorbing** |

### 4.2 Transition table (19 legal edges)

```
                   ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
                   │                                                  │
   (create)        ▼                                                  │
      │      ┌───────────┐  evidence_withdrawn   ┌───────────┐        │
      └─────►│ PROPOSED  │◄──────────────────────│ CANDIDATE │        │
             └─────┬─────┘                       └─────┬─────┘        │
                   │  deterministic_evidence           │              │
                   └──────────────────────────────────►│              │
                                                       │ court_ratification
                                                       ▼              │
             ┌────────────┐   supersession       ┌───────────┐        │
             │ DEPRECATED │◄─────────────────────│  ACTIVE   │        │
             └──────┬─────┘  court_ratification  └─────┬─────┘        │
                    │        ────────────────────►     │              │
                    │  supersession                    │ supersession │
                    ▼                                  ▼              │
             ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐       │
             │                  SUPERSEDED                    │       │
             └───────────────────────┬────────────────────────┘       │
                                     │ falsification                  │
   any non-terminal ──integrity_alarm──►  QUARANTINED ────────────────┘
                                     │        │ adversary_cleared
                                     ▼        │ falsification
                            ┌────────────────┐▼
                            │   RETRACTED    │  ◄── absorbing: no outbound edge
                            └────────────────┘      no DELETED state exists
```

| From | To | Permitted `basis` |
|---|---|---|
| `PROPOSED` | `CANDIDATE` | `deterministic_evidence`, `court_ratification`, `founder_ratification` |
| `PROPOSED` | `QUARANTINED` | `integrity_alarm` |
| `PROPOSED` | `RETRACTED` | `falsification`, `founder_ratification` |
| `CANDIDATE` | `ACTIVE` | `court_ratification`, `deterministic_evidence`, `founder_ratification` |
| `CANDIDATE` | `PROPOSED` | `evidence_withdrawn` |
| `CANDIDATE` | `QUARANTINED` | `integrity_alarm` |
| `CANDIDATE` | `RETRACTED` | `falsification`, `founder_ratification` |
| `ACTIVE` | `DEPRECATED` | `supersession`, `court_ratification`, `founder_ratification` |
| `ACTIVE` | `SUPERSEDED` | `supersession` |
| `ACTIVE` | `QUARANTINED` | `integrity_alarm` |
| `ACTIVE` | `RETRACTED` | `falsification`, `founder_ratification` |
| `DEPRECATED` | `ACTIVE` | `court_ratification`, `founder_ratification` |
| `DEPRECATED` | `SUPERSEDED` | `supersession` |
| `DEPRECATED` | `QUARANTINED` | `integrity_alarm` |
| `DEPRECATED` | `RETRACTED` | `falsification`, `founder_ratification` |
| `QUARANTINED` | `ACTIVE` | `adversary_cleared` |
| `QUARANTINED` | `CANDIDATE` | `adversary_cleared` |
| `QUARANTINED` | `RETRACTED` | `falsification`, `founder_ratification` |
