## 9. Risks

| Risk | Severity | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| Field roster is wrong (A0) | **High** | §7 gate; `assumptions.md` §4 checklist; structure designed to survive renames |
| `jsonschema` not in the dependency set | Medium | `uv add jsonschema` is an IMPLEMENT prerequisite; acceptance command 2 fails loudly at import if missed (A12) |
| `unevaluatedProperties` misapplied as `additionalProperties` | Medium | §6.1 static guard test; symptom is silent over-rejection, so a test is the only reliable catch |
| Sibling `.expect.json` files inflating the acceptance globs | Medium | Expectations live in `fixtures/envelope/manifest.json`, one level *above* `valid/` and `invalid/`, so `ls .../invalid/*.json` counts only fixtures. Do not move it into the fixture dirs. |
| `anyOf` error messages unusable for transition failures | Low | §4.4 implementation note: normalise to `/promotion` + `anyOf` |
| Corpus grows without coverage | Low | §6.4 tests derive expectations from the schema, so a new status/field/invariant fails until covered |
